The AICA direct mixer in runtime/aica_mixer.h uses register definitions,
Yamaha ADPCM decoding constants and envelope timing tables from the Flycast
and reicast sound-generation implementation:
https://github.com/flyinghead/flycast/blob/master/core/hw/aica/sgc_if.cpp

Copyright the Flycast and reicast contributors. Their source is licensed under
the GNU General Public License version 2 or (at your option) any later version.
Some envelope/filter work in that source credits Highly Theoretical by Neill
Corlett. The kit's mixer is also GPL-2.0-or-later; see LICENSE.dcrecomp.

This kit does not include commercial game audio, sound banks, disc images,
firmware or generated translations. The sound driver and samples must come
from the user's local disc.
